 virtual reality kunt ervaren. De headset is geschikt voor gaming, entertainment en interactieve VR-ervaringen zonder dat een pc of console nodig is. Dankzij de krachtige hardware, bewegingsdetectie en controllers kun je realistisch bewegen en interactie hebben in virtuele werelden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"418\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"402\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"405\">Nieuw In Seal</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"661\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"435\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"438\">⭐ Standalone VR-headset zonder pc of console<br data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\">⭐ Geschikt voor VR-games, apps en entertainment<br data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"535\">⭐ Bewegingsdetectie voor realistische interactie<br data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"586\">⭐ Draadloze vrijheid tijdens gebruik<br data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\">⭐ Ruime opslag voor VR-games en apps</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"1002\">📋 <strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"683\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"686\"><strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"696\">Model:</strong> Meta Quest 3S<br data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"713\"><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"724\">Opslag:</strong> 256GB<br data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"742\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Type:</strong> Standalone VR-headset<br data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"779\">Display:</strong> VR-display met hoge resolutie<br data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"812\"><strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"825\">Tracking:</strong> Inside-out tracking met bewegingssensoren<br data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"889\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB-C<br data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"931\">Controllers:</strong> Motion controllers<br data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\"><strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"963\">Kleur:</strong> Wit / White<br data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"978\"><strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"988\">Staat:</strong> Nieuw In Seal</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1072\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1022\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1025\">Meta Quest 3S VR-headset<br data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1052\">2 Motion controllers</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1133\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1096\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1099\">Incl. Garantie: 6 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>",
